data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":83,"item_id":"rs_043f940e2dedf4f7016aca5466ab4c8193acf94782fcd7bc11","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning migration tests**\n\nI’m focusing on simulating the migration process by removing a column after existing tasks are populated. I realize this requires restarting since SQLite supports dropping columns. I'll append tests to the end with the drop column feature and ensure that the default tests are also restarted. It seems I've got the right approach, but I need to double-check everything to make sure the migration runs smoothly. Let's keep everything organized!"}

